## Original Content
DES DIVAS ET DES BIJOUX (1/6) - Ses bijoux, la star country préférait les coudre sur ses tenues insensées, pleines de paillettes et de perlouses. Un univers de strass pour mieux mettre en lumière son aura féministe et philanthropique adulée par l'Amérique.

## Summary
This article describes how country music star Dolly Parton sews both real and fake jewelry onto her extravagant outfits. Her use of glitter and rhinestones emphasizes her feminist and philanthropic image, which is widely admired in America.

## Key Points
- Dolly Parton incorporates a mix of real and fake jewelry into her clothing.
- Her fashion choices are used to highlight her feminist and philanthropic persona.
- The article is part of a series focused on divas and jewels.


